        "info": "# Configuration Flow\nConfiguration flow for settings and debugging of entered config.\n\n## Information Input\nThe following information set needs to be set as \"flow\" variables to be available within the complete workflow.\n\n1. UUID for serialnumber for later message filter\n2. Machine ID from QFPR, to address right API endpoint\n3. URL from QFPR, to address right URL and API\n\n## Debug Flow Config\nGeneral function to get a debug notification, how the configuration flow is set up and which information set was entered there.",
